    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="16cc893e-e1c8-54ea-b27c-17ecbe5b46dc" activityNameId="6a9a94e5-9273-54cc-bdfb-6952b57ad7c9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Stone mastic asphalt (SMA) surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Stone mastic asphalt (SMA) surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant
Modern Swiss technologies for regional storage facilities, material extraction, and asphalt production. Based on survey data from 73 asphalt mixing plants. 
UUID: 7ea03ee1-5bad-45af-a9c2-413265ec355b
This dataset covers the production of average stone mastic asphalt (SMA) surface layers in Switzerland, with 0% reclaimed asphalt. The process represents an average SMA, derived from the mean material composition of SMA 8 and SMA 11 layers. It includes raw material extraction, transportation, and manufacturing processes.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of hot mix asphalt (stone mastic asphalt SMA), using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 351352456 t 
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ea03ee1-5bad-45af-a9c2-413265ec355b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
